shares and weighted-average diluted shares outstanding are equal for this period.</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">  </span></p></ix:continuation></div><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p><div><ix:nonNumeric id="F_575dd805-3ee4-4903-9f34-2861a4366665" contextRef="C_17e2b030-4567-401b-b6fb-2fc757677249" name="us-gaap:IncomeTaxDisclosureTextBlock" escape="true" continuedAt="F_575dd805-3ee4-4903-9f34-2861a4366665_1"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:18pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Note 11. Income Taxes</span></p><div style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_a0ba02c1-f580-43ac-b83f-adbd2ea04c5b" contextRef="C_17e2b030-4567-401b-b6fb-2fc757677249" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfComponentsOfIncomeTaxExpenseBenefitTableTextBlock" escape="true"><p style="text-indent:4.533%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The provision (benefit) for income taxes consisted of the following:</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p>
